# Contributing — Pull request workflow

Fork: Fork
Fork -> Concept: clone repo

Concept: Add concept to\nconcepts.json
Concept -> Generator

Generator: Write Go\ngenerator
Generator -> Fuzz

Fuzz: Write fuzz test\n(1 000 samples)
Fuzz -> Validate

Validate: Run validator\nvalidate_graph.go
Validate -> PR

PR: Open\npull request
PR -> CI

CI: CI passes? {
  shape: diamond
}

CI -> Review: "Yes"
CI -> Fix: "No" {
  style.stroke: "#B53333"
  style.font-color: "#B53333"
}

Review: Maintainer\nreview
Review -> Merge

Merge: Merged! {
  style: {
    fill: "#EEF2F7"
    stroke: "#1B365D"
  }
}

Fix: Fix issues
Fix -> PR

nodes: {
  style: {
    font-size: 12
    font-color: "#141413"
    border-radius: 4
    stroke: "#6b6a64"
  }
}

edges: {
  style: {
    stroke: "#504e49"
    font-size: 10
    font-color: "#504e49"
  }
}
